but dying chars stop earning -> income halved (607->269) -> throttles the stockpile.
So spend the SURPLUS (we finally have one) on the one counter to poison's tick.
Effect/verify: deaths should fall toward ~0.2-0.3/1k, income recover, gold still
accumulate above the 100 floor toward the 529 cap test. FALSIFIED if deaths stay high
